// The plugin's export (and anything written by hand): {format: 'nano-snes-sidecar', version: 1, channels: {'1': {preset, volume, pan}, ...}, presets: {name: def}}
// Channels are numbered 1..16 as in FL and MIDI. Unknown keys are refused, not ignored.
